]}, "change_log": "v1.0.15 \u2014 Soccer UpdateNew Arena \u2014 Soccer\n\n* Score goals, dodge the keeper, and fight for the ball in a brand-new team objective mode!\n* Available from your Watch \u2192 Arcade Mode \u2192 Soccer.\n\n\nWeekly Challenge \u2014 Disarmed\n\n* Sever 50 body parts in Chopping Mode this week.\n* Reward: EMP Orb\n* Community Credit \u2014 Huge shoutout to @ASTRAL_NC, whose original suggestion inspired EMP! Unlock it through this week's challenge.\n\n\nNew Blade \u2014 Sky blade\n\n* Take flight with a sleek, wing-shaped blade. Now in the shop in 3 colors!\n* Community Credit \u2014 Huge shoutout to @The Roaring Knight, whose winning design in our Blade Design Contest brought Sky blade to life!\n\n\nImprovements\n\n* Watch Redesign\n    * Watch panel now animates smoothly in and out, and its windows no longer overlap.\n    * New setting: wear your Watch on either wrist.\n* Redirect\n    * Redirect now springs to the nearest player instead of a random one, so it reliably finds someone to hit.\n* Accessibility\n    * Only have one controller: You can now access Watch settings from the new Menu on the lobby computer.\n* Bug Fixes\n    * Fixed an issue where performance could degrade after joining a crowded room later.\n    * Fixed a bug where the Watch's opt-in button could occasionally trigger on its own while walking around.\n* A few daily quests have also been temporarily removed while we work on improvements.", "created_date": 1788496699, "id": "1707007461425187", "version": "1.0.15a", "version_code": 193, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1614607450665189", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1707007461425187"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1788492863, "id": "1706968028095797", "version": "1.0.15a", "version_code": 192, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1614607450665189", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1707007461425187"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1788490418, "id": "1706941688098431", "version": "1.0.15a", "version_code": 191, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1614607450665189", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1707007461425187"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2403174663506544"}]}, "change_log": "v1.0.15 \u2014 Soccer UpdateNew Arena \u2014 Soccer\n\n* Score goals, dodge the keeper, and fight for the ball in a brand-new team objective mode!\n* Available from your Watch \u2192 Arcade Mode \u2192 Soccer.\n\n\nWeekly Challenge \u2014 Disarmed\n\n* Sever 50 body parts in Chopping Mode this week.\n* Reward: EMP Orb\n* Community Credit \u2014 Huge shoutout to @ASTRAL_NC, whose original suggestion inspired EMP! Unlock it through this week's challenge.\n\n\nNew Blade \u2014 Sky blade\n\n* Take flight with a sleek, wing-shaped blade. Now in the shop in 3 colors!\n* Community Credit \u2014 Huge shoutout to @The Roaring Knight, whose winning design in our Blade Design Contest brought Sky blade to life!\n\n\nImprovements\n\n* Watch Redesign\n    * Watch panel now animates smoothly in and out, and its windows no longer overlap.\n    * New setting: wear your Watch on either wrist.\n* Redirect\n    * Redirect now springs to the nearest player instead of a random one, so it reliably finds someone to hit.\n* Accessibility\n    * Only have one controller: You can now access Watch settings from the new Menu on the lobby computer.\n* Bug Fixes\n    * Fixed an issue where performance could degrade after joining a crowded room later.\n    * Fixed a bug where the Watch's opt-in button could occasionally trigger on its own while walking around.\n* A few daily quests have also been temporarily removed while we work on improvements.", "created_date": 1788395485, "id": "1705898611536072", "version": "1.0.15", "version_code": 188, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1614607450665189", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1707007461425187"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1788392263, "id": "1705869218205678", "version": "1.0.15", "version_code": 186, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}